From 8b52465579e6b6128abb4c7e067385b79eb43edc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pypto-x agent <agent@pypto-x.local>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 04:38:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 282/283] feat(execution): register the batch-2 opcodes with
 frozen view semantics

- add OpContracts for add/mul/rsqrt/transpose/slice/broadcast on the batch-1
  schema v3 (precision, semantics, attribute schema, view obligation):
  * add/mul: elementwise trailing-axis broadcast + scalar operands (no implicit
    dtype promotion); tensor-tensor broadcast lowers to an explicit
    broadcast+elementwise program shared by the lowering cross-check and the
    portable provider, so a legal broadcast executes instead of being refused;
  * rsqrt: float-only reciprocal sqrt with documented 0/negative/NaN/inf and
    subnormal semantics;
  * transpose/slice/broadcast: view semantics frozen first - may_alias with an
    explicit budgeted materialize path, view_mode forbid/prefer/require,
    inplace/valid_shape rules, stride legality; view_mode=require is refused
    with a structured ALIAS_PROOF_UNAVAILABLE and never silently materializes.
- add the two batch-1 contract patches as strictly additive verifier-level
  admission extensions (the frozen where/compare documents and contract
  digests stay byte-identical): where scalar fill operands and the redundant
  compare.broadcast declaration; existing legal requests resolve identically.
- freeze the operation-scoped portable capability manifest per batch: batch-1
  requests keep their ten-contract document, batch-2 requests declare sixteen,
  the default probe and matmul/qmatmul paths are untouched.
- extend execute_operation/providers with scalar operand handles
  (LaunchRequest.scalars) and a structured operand_value_rejected error.
- tests: test_execution_ops_registry_batch2.py (38) plus inventory updates;
  python/tests/ut/pypto_x execution suites 524 passed.
- zero default change: 12 frozen runs (matmul/qmatmul + batch-1 opcodes) keep
  contract/capability/plan/artifact/output digests byte-identical to 41ae82a01
  (evidence _meta/pypto-x/u-ops-registry-batch2/raw/frozen_record_*).
- U5 missing-contract table on the three real Qwen3.5 graphs: 19 -> 13 classes,
  mul/transpose/broadcast/slice/add/rsqrt all gone.

- op_bench selftest: the unregistered-opcode injection moves from add to sub
  (add is now registered); the inventory tests in the execution suites grow the
  six new opcodes without touching any frozen digest.

(cherry picked from commit 79e528560535e9ed12a44dfa2ab6ee0f6cb0f344)
